74-wendi-p0133","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p074"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p034-wendi-p0133","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p034"]},{"id":"zhanggu-m-b052addb6eb84948c992","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及张昭","evidence":["zhanggu-q-605863b2854dc32029ba","zhanggu-q-3daa3c56b9872fdc7a53","zhanggu-q-c039f678424f90498d02","zhanggu-q-9680d4016f3c0b32de1c","zhanggu-q-3215c5e9ab764830a188"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-306730bf61f0cc18b602","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及张昭，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-2d9e6a1d93a8f42f869b"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-72f6af5a1bfb99f33a49","kind":"mention","text":"陈寿评曰：孙策待张纮，亚于张昭","evidence":["zhangyan-q-118dd7b542a20ec2838a"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-b58cce7239ea728e5709","kind":"mention","text":"《江表传》称权惟呼张昭曰“张公”，所以重之","evidence":["zhangyan-q-e093329ff2b68f01c826"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-d41aad9060a9f3ff6886","kind":"mention","text":"陈琳答书言“今景兴在此，足下与子布在彼”","evidence":["zhangyan-q-724d064396548a23545e"]},{"id":"yululu-m-c863b6dab07cde1291d0","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及张昭，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-3c93a8864d07025773f9"]},{"id":"yululu-m-e99728befba4ec133b2f","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及张昭，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-db98a8a58bcc8552a010"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-5a4e3fbca5cd4f35f414","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-acee24518fc66dcee7d3","layer":"original","quote":"张昭字子布，彭城人也。少好学，善隶书。从白侯子安受《左氏春秋》，博览众书；与琅邪赵昱、东海王朗俱发名友善〖1〗。弱冠察孝廉〖2〗，不就。与朗共论旧君讳事〖3〗，州里才士陈琳等皆称善之〖4〗。﹝一﹞刺史陶谦举茂才，不应；谦以为轻己，遂见拘执。昱倾身营救，方以得免。汉末大乱，徐方士民多避难扬土〖5〗，昭皆南渡江。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"wendi-p0133":{"fields":[{"id":"wendi-p0133-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"子布","evidence":["zhanggu-q-5a4e3fbca5cd4f35f414"]},{"id":"featured-review-wendi-p0133-home","key":"home","label":"籍